{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE5L0JlbmVhdGglMjBUaGUlMjBMZWF2ZXMlMjAlMjgyMDE5JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Beneath The Leaves","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/dCu6Pi4YUtgvR2uOSeVieYdu7iK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zy4zTAS6R58cogMHDXs3E6KgsKt.jpg","description":"Four small-town boys are kidnapped by James Whitley, a warm-eyed psychopath. His grotesque pursuit to reunite orphaned children with their deceased birth parents is halted when the boys escape and he is arrested. Fifteen years later Whitley flees during a prison fire and decides to see his mission through. Detective Larson, once Whitley's prior victim, is removed from the case due to impartiality leaving his partner, and lover, Detective Shotwell to solve the case. Fueled by rage and a chance of redemption, Detective Larson chases the steadfast psychopath on his own only to fall back into the same trap he once escaped as a child.","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Thriller","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.2","runtime":"90 min","cast":["Mira Sorvino","Paul Sorvino","Kristoffer Polaha","Doug Jones","Aaron Farb","Ser'Darius Blain","Christopher Backus","Christopher Masterson"],"director":["Adam Marino"],"released":"2019-02-08T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Be patient and wait for due harvest.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Mira Sorvino","character":"Detective Erica Shotwell","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3CPM8yvppihiKsA1pf4x8PJe4x6.jpg"},{"name":"Paul Sorvino","character":"Captain Parker","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1gF0UskusEdDcNaBDJ2CMsz5Agi.jpg"},{"name":"Kristoffer Polaha","character":"Detective Brian Larson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u7SIxQzDwzU1av7tJoHG62NzN1Y.jpg"},{"name":"Doug Jones","character":"James Whitley","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rpvvWATYWHGjedJea0G97XufOwU.jpg"},{"name":"Aaron Farb","character":"Detective Abrams","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4c7Inyq6ieEvo